  "notes": "Stamp S3Bat pinout. Edge pad labels from the diagram (G<n>); the board silkscreen spellings (GPIO<n>, 3.3V, VBAT, WAKE) are listed first in functions. The 0.4mm 24P BTB(DVP) connector uses the printed numbers 1-24 (odd on the lower row, even on the upper row; pin 1/2 also marked on the board photo). SYS_VUBS is printed as one box spanning pins 21 and 23; both take that label, spelled as printed. The white JST connector and antenna connector are unlabeled and skipped. Category legend (UART, I2C, M5PM1, GPIO, BAT, POWER, GND) omitted."
